{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Snakes and Ladders is a visually enhanced digital version of the classic board game, set in a dynamic 3D environment. Players move across a 3D board filled with animated snakes and ladders. The game supports a single-player mode where the player competes against multiple AI opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Single Player: Play against 1\u20133 AI-controlled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-AI Opponents: Multiple AI difficulty levels for varied challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-6 Different characters available for the player in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Animated Snakes: Snakes slither and animate when a player lands on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Climbable Ladders: Characters visually climb ladders in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-3D Environment: Fully rendered board with zoom, rotate, and pan camera controls. 12 different challenges available for the player. Difficulty increases after each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Many More.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705010?t=1749564477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705010/dc758e72b8b44295f058b07493b16ffdb91bf72d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749564477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705010/35a10932209bf68f4ca66acbe8426923a0f819f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749564477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705010/35a10932209bf68f4ca66acbe8426923a0f819f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749564477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Snakes and Ladders is a visually enhanced digital version of the classic board game, set in a dynamic 3D environment. Players move across a 3D board filled with animated snakes and ladders. The game supports a single-player mode where the player competes against multiple AI opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Single Player: Play against 1\u20133 AI-controlled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-AI Opponents: Multiple AI difficulty levels for varied challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-6 Different characters available for the player in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Animated Snakes: Snakes slither and animate when a player lands on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Climbable Ladders: Characters visually climb ladders in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-3D Environment: Fully rendered board with zoom, rotate, and pan camera controls. 12 different challenges available for the player. Difficulty increases after each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Many More.</p>","developers":["Yash Future Tech Solutions Pvt Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705010/c8ae7ee1ff1076a428ea87f6e9c09aea73413403/header.jpg?t=1749564477","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All Rights Reserved by Yash Future Tech Solutions Pvt Ltd","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152543,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152543/movie480.mp4?t=1749564474","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152543/movie_max.mp4?t=1749564474"},"name":"Snakes and Ladders Championship Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152543/bb75a078a54eae33844a8870c0a310ead88970c1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749564474","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.